            <description xml:lang="zh-Hans"><![CDATA[<style>
  h2 { font-size: 1.05em; margin: 0 0 .5em; }
  ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2em; }
  li { margin: .3em 0; }
  p { margin: .8em 0 0; }
</style><h2>Blinky 1.5.3</h2><ul><li><strong>更新之后，访达里显示的是 Blinky。</strong> 文件名仍是 <code>Pulse.app</code> 的那一份，在下次打开时（包括应用内更新后的重新打开）会改名为 <code>Blinky.app</code>，前提是同一文件夹里还没有 <code>Blinky.app</code>；原先开着开机自启的，会按新文件重新登记，开关在「设置 → 通用」。<a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/58">#58</a></li><li><strong>预测重置的倒计时与标题同一行。</strong> Codex 卡片上，倒计时在「预测重置」的右侧，本地的日期和时刻在下一行。<a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/blob/main/Docs/providers/codex.md">Docs/providers/codex.md</a> <a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/59">#59</a></li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/releases/tag/v1.5.3">在 GitHub 查看更新说明</a></p>]]></description>
            <description xml:lang="zh-Hant"><![CDATA[<style>
  h2 { font-size: 1.05em; margin: 0 0 .5em; }
  ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2em; }
  li { margin: .3em 0; }
  p { margin: .8em 0 0; }
</style><h2>Blinky 1.5.3</h2><ul><li><strong>更新之后，访达里显示的是 Blinky。</strong> 文件名仍是 <code>Pulse.app</code> 的那一份，在下次打开时（包括应用内更新后的重新打开）会改名为 <code>Blinky.app</code>，前提是同一文件夹里还没有 <code>Blinky.app</code>；原先开着开机自启的，会按新文件重新登记，开关在「设置 → 通用」。<a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/58">#58</a></li><li><strong>预测重置的倒计时与标题同一行。</strong> Codex 卡片上，倒计时在「预测重置」的右侧，本地的日期和时刻在下一行。<a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/blob/main/Docs/providers/codex.md">Docs/providers/codex.md</a> <a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/59">#59</a></li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/releases/tag/v1.5.3">在 GitHub 查看更新说明</a></p>]]></description>
            <description xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[<style>
  h2 { font-size: 1.05em; margin: 0 0 .5em; }
  ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2em; }
  li { margin: .3em 0; }
  p { margin: .8em 0 0; }
</style><h2>Blinky 1.5.3</h2><ul><li><strong>An installed update shows up in Finder as Blinky.</strong> The next time a copy still named <code>Pulse.app</code> opens, including the relaunch after an in-app update, it renames itself to <code>Blinky.app</code> when that folder has no <code>Blinky.app</code> yet, and Open at login is registered again for the new file when it was already on (Settings → General). <a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/58">#58</a></li><li><strong>The predicted-reset countdown shares its title row.</strong> On the Codex card, the time remaining sits beside Predicted reset, and the local date and time are on the line below. <a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/blob/main/Docs/providers/codex.md">Docs/providers/codex.md</a> <a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/59">#59</a></li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/releases/tag/v1.5.3">Release notes on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
